Personal Bio
I’m a studying data scientist at Oregon State University wanting to double major in Business Analytics and Data Science. I have a background education in Statistics, Calculus, and Computer Science classes and I am currently taking Discretionary Math and 300 level Statistics. Ever since I was young I have been interested in tracking statistics and manipulating the data to draw my own conclusions. Whether it was through video games that I was playing like Minecraft or Civilization, or through creating my own fictional sports leagues, I would track data and then create formulas to look at the data in a new way, using Excel as my medium. I am passionate about numbers, getting creative with data, and collaborating with a wide range of people. I am ready and willing to learn more about the subject and discover the wide range of possibilities that the field of Data Science can offer me in the future.
